{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v5.json",
  "description": "CHART PAIR: 'Programs for everyone but teens' (heatmap, left) + 'Why they come: <group>' (bars, right). Section 5. Clicking a row of the heatmap (param 'paud') picks an age group; the bars show that group's reasons for attending.",
  "hconcat": [
    {
      "description": "LEFT CHART - HEATMAP: states across the top, age groups down the side. The transform calculates attendances per 1,000 residents (per_1000), which sets the colour. CHANNELS: y position = audience (nominal); x position = abbr (nominal).",
      "name": "heat",
      "width": 330,
      "height": 250,
      "title": {
        "text": "Programs for everyone but teens",
        "subtitle": [
          "Attendances per 1,000 residents, 2024–25.",
          "The teen row is the palest in every state."
        ]
      },
      "data": {
        "url": "data/programs_by_audience_2024_25.csv",
        "format": {
          "parse": {
            "participants": "number",
            "population_millions": "number"
          }
        }
      },
      "transform": [
        {
          "calculate": "datum.participants / (datum.population_millions*1000)",
          "as": "per_1000"
        }
      ],
      "encoding": {
        "y": {
          "field": "audience",
          "type": "nominal",
          "title": null,
          "sort": [
            "Early childhood",
            "Children",
            "Young adult",
            "Adults",
            "Seniors",
            "All ages"
          ],
          "axis": {
            "domain": false,
            "ticks": false,
            "labelFontSize": 13,
            "labelExpr": "datum.label=='Early childhood' ? 'Under 5s' : datum.label=='Young adult' ? 'Teens' : datum.label"
          }
        },
        "x": {
          "field": "abbr",
          "type": "nominal",
          "title": null,
          "axis": {
            "labelAngle": 0,
            "orient": "top",
            "domain": false,
            "ticks": false,
            "labelFontSize": 12
          }
        }
      },
      "layer": [
        {
          "description": "HEATMAP LAYER 1 - THE COLOURED SQUARES + THE CLICK. 'paud' records the clicked age group (starts on Young adult = Teens). Colour: pale to dark plum, square-root scale so small values still differ. CHANNELS: colour = per_1000 (quantitative).",
          "params": [
            {
              "name": "paud",
              "select": {
                "type": "point",
                "fields": [
                  "audience"
                ],
                "toggle": false
              },
              "value": [
                {
                  "audience": "Young adult"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "mark": {
            "type": "rect",
            "stroke": "white",
            "strokeWidth": 2,
            "cursor": "pointer"
          },
          "encoding": {
            "color": {
              "field": "per_1000",
              "type": "quantitative",
              "title": "Per 1,000",
              "scale": {
                "type": "sqrt",
                "range": [
                  "#f6e3ec",
                  "#a33b6a",
                  "#5c1435"
                ]
              },
              "legend": null
            },
            "tooltip": [
              {
                "field": "state",
                "title": "State"
              },
              {
                "field": "audience",
                "title": "Audience"
              },
              {
                "field": "participants",
                "title": "Attendances",
                "format": ","
              },
              {
                "field": "per_1000",
                "title": "Per 1,000 residents",
                "format": ".0f"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "HEATMAP LAYER 2 - THE NUMBER IN EACH SQUARE (white on dark squares, dark on light ones). CHANNELS: text = per_1000; colour changes when datum.per_1000 > 70.",
          "mark": {
            "type": "text",
            "fontSize": 12
          },
          "encoding": {
            "text": {
              "field": "per_1000",
              "format": ".0f"
            },
            "color": {
              "condition": {
                "test": "datum.per_1000 > 70",
                "value": "white"
              },
              "value": "#2d2a26"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "HEATMAP LAYER 3 - THE DARK OUTLINE around the selected row. It only keeps the clicked group (filter on 'paud') and draws one unfilled rectangle across the full row.",
          "transform": [
            {
              "filter": {
                "param": "paud",
                "empty": false
              }
            },
            {
              "aggregate": [
                {
                  "op": "count",
                  "as": "n"
                }
              ],
              "groupby": [
                "audience"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "mark": {
            "type": "rect",
            "fill": null,
            "stroke": "#2d2a26",
            "strokeWidth": 3,
            "cornerRadius": 2
          },
          "encoding": {
            "x": null
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "RIGHT CHART - 'Why they come' BARS: share of the selected group's attendances by program purpose. Transforms: keep the clicked group, add up attendances per purpose, then divide by the group total to get each share. CHANNELS: y position = outcome (nominal); x position = share (quantitative).",
      "name": "outcomes",
      "width": 210,
      "height": 250,
      "title": {
        "text": {
          "expr": "'Why they come: ' + (paud && paud.audience ? (paud.audience[0]=='Early childhood' ? 'Under 5s' : paud.audience[0]=='Young adult' ? 'Teens' : paud.audience[0]) : 'everyone')"
        },
        "subtitle": "Share of attendances by program purpose",
        "fontSize": 15
      },
      "data": {
        "url": "data/programs_purpose_by_audience_2024_25.csv",
        "format": {
          "parse": {
            "participants": "number"
          }
        }
      },
      "transform": [
        {
          "filter": {
            "param": "paud"
          }
        },
        {
          "aggregate": [
            {
              "op": "sum",
              "field": "participants",
              "as": "p"
            }
          ],
          "groupby": [
            "outcome"
          ]
        },
        {
          "joinaggregate": [
            {
              "op": "sum",
              "field": "p",
              "as": "tot"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "calculate": "datum.p/datum.tot",
          "as": "share"
        }
      ],
      "encoding": {
        "y": {
          "field": "outcome",
          "type": "nominal",
          "title": null,
          "sort": {
            "field": "share",
            "order": "descending"
          },
          "axis": null,
          "scale": {
            "paddingInner": 0.55,
            "paddingOuter": 0.3
          }
        },
        "x": {
          "field": "share",
          "type": "quantitative",
          "title": null,
          "axis": null,
          "scale": {
            "domain": [
              0,
              1.05
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "layer": [
        {
          "description": "BARS LAYER 1 - THE BARS (length = share).",
          "mark": {
            "type": "bar",
            "color": "#a33b6a",
            "cornerRadiusEnd": 3
          },
          "encoding": {
            "tooltip": [
              {
                "field": "outcome",
                "title": "Purpose"
              },
              {
                "field": "p",
                "title": "Attendances",
                "format": ","
              },
              {
                "field": "share",
                "title": "Share",
                "format": ".0%"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "BARS LAYER 2 - THE % LABEL at the end of each bar. CHANNELS: text = share.",
          "mark": {
            "type": "text",
            "align": "left",
            "dx": 5,
            "fontSize": 13,
            "fontWeight": "bold",
            "color": "#a33b6a"
          },
          "encoding": {
            "text": {
              "field": "share",
              "format": ".0%"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "BARS LAYER 3 - THE PURPOSE NAME above each bar (used instead of an axis). CHANNELS: text = outcome; x position fixed at 0.",
          "mark": {
            "type": "text",
            "align": "left",
            "baseline": "bottom",
            "dy": -9,
            "fontSize": 13,
            "color": "#2d2a26"
          },
          "encoding": {
            "text": {
              "field": "outcome"
            },
            "x": {
              "value": 0
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "spacing": 24,
  "resolve": {
    "scale": {
      "color": "independent"
    }
  }
}